WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:13.220
I mapped Mars for nine years. I measured the height of the whole planet with a laser and took over 240,000 pictures.

2
00:00:13.920 --> 00:00:26.790
Then a mistake in a command sent months earlier made me turn one of my batteries towards the Sun. It overheated, and I went quiet. I'm still up here, circling.

3
00:00:27.490 --> 00:00:32.080
One wrong command, and I turned my battery to the Sun.
